The '''Boreal War''' (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2329|1935 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – DAY MONTH {{abbr|2340|1944 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) was a [[wikipedia:world war|global conflict]] almost exclusively fought in the [[Northern Hemisphere (Basis)|Northern Hemisphere]] of [[Basis]]. 

==Background==
===Political and military alliances===
The structural reasons that explain the outbreak of the Boreal War include strong [[wikipedia:nationalism|nationalism]], the rise of [[wikipedia:imperialism|imperialism]], and the expansionist ambitions associated with them, such as [[Holarian irredentism]], previous unresolved conflicts ([[NAME War]]<!--War between Astamon and Zandomia--> and [[Holaro–Thyonese War]]<!--Late 23rd century war between Holaria and Thyon over Tamodia, possibly?-->), to which are added economic rivalries, a complex system of military alliances developed between the different [[Daroch]]ian and [[Meran]]ian countries during the early {{abbr|24th century|1910.67 to 1993.74 (Earth Years Equivalent)}} following the tumultuous {{abbr|23rd century|1827.6 to 1910.67 (Earth Years Equivalent)}}, which notably saw the [[Qymo–Thyonese Wars]]<!--Series of small scale wars between Thyon and Qym--> and the [[OCEAN War]]<!--War between Prugundy and Astamon, possibly, or others.-->. 

In [[Meran]], a shift in alliances between the great powers occurred in the decade before the war. [[Qym]], whose historical rivals were in [[Southern Meran]], particularly [[Prugundy]] and [[Thyon]], signed a [[Qymo–Thyonese Non-Aggression Pact|non-aggression pact]] with the latter in {{abbr|2323|1929.78 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. That same year, [[Prugundy]], a long-standing Thyonese ally, allied with [[Holaria]], a long-standing Qymish ally and Thyonese rival, as well as with the [[Daroch]]ian great power of [[Riuden]]. Two years later in {{abbr|2325|1931.44 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, the three powers signed a new alliance treaty with [[Zandomia]] that became known as the [[Great Alliance]]. 

In response, the [[Nagur Pact]] was signed on DAY MONTH {{abbr|2327|1933 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} in [[Nagur]], [[County of Nagur]], [[Qym]], by the representatives of [[Astamon]], [[Gosaria]], [[Imendia]], and [[Qym]]. After several diplomatic overtures and personal visits by [[Bacha XV of Qym|King Bacha XV]] to [[Polamdi]], [[Thyon]] officially joined the pact on DAY MONTH {{abbr|2329|1935 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} along with [[Tamodia]], while a Holarian military build-up was ongoing at their respective borders.

==Prelude==
*[[Holaria]] wants [[Tamodia]]; threatens [[Thyon]] and [[Qym]]. 
*[[Prugundy]] fears [[Qym]] and it allies with other countries in [[Meran]] and [[Daroch]], forming the [[Great Alliance]]. 
*U/C

