===Memorials===
Thousands of memorials were built after the war to commemorate specific battles or casualties in general. 

The [[Boreal War Memorial (Teurek)|Boreal War Memorial]] in [[Teurek]] is the largest memorial in [[Qym]], commemorating the fierce [[Battle of Teurek]]. It holds the remains of 75,000 identified Qymish soldiers and over 125,000 unknown soldiers, honoring 200,000 soldiers in total. U/C

